(4702619, 678484, 90777, '<td valign="top">A good image, I would like to see the top of the shop window to add to the framing of the whole image.  Also try a polarizing filter to cut out the reflection of yourself and the street opposite the shop.</td>', 'A good image, I would like to see the top of the shop window to add to the framing of the whole image.  Also try a polarizing filter to cut out the reflection of yourself and the street opposite the shop.', '2008-05-14 19:20:53.000000', NULL, 1),
