(4702642, 678479, 90777, '<td valign="top">A great capture.  I know it was probably outside of your control but it would have been awesome to see his wheels lined up with the tree in the background</td>', 'A great capture.  I know it was probably outside of your control but it would have been awesome to see his wheels lined up with the tree in the background', '2008-05-14 19:35:47.000000', NULL, 1),
