(4702662, 678276, 90777, '<td valign="top">Love the colours and strong shilouette(sp?) , and I won''t even mention the powerlines as i feel they add to the deliniation of the orange and blue.  I would however liked to have seen the rider in a more side-on profile.  This is so cool and would love to see your outtakes.</td>', 'Love the colours and strong shilouette(sp?) , and I won''t even mention the powerlines as i feel they add to the deliniation of the orange and blue.  I would however liked to have seen the rider in a more side-on profile.  This is so cool and would love to see your outtakes.', '2008-05-14 19:52:14.000000', NULL, 1),
