(4702752, 678516, 49773, '<td valign="top">This is a great story depicted. With such little information shown... Like in the good old times, when the village boys use to double the fun riding red cheeked girls on the top of the wheel...<br/>Guess this photograph will be rather unappriciated. But to me it''s wonderful!</td>', 'This is a great story depicted. With such little information shown... Like in the good old times, when the village boys use to double the fun riding red cheeked girls on the top of the wheel...Guess this photograph will be rather unappriciated. But to me it''s wonderful!', '2008-05-14 20:33:02.000000', NULL, 1),
