(4703509, 678514, 59737, '<td valign="top">Interesting, the thickness of the tires throws me off a little but I like the image and the faint spokes</td>', 'Interesting, the thickness of the tires throws me off a little but I like the image and the faint spokes', '2008-05-15 01:55:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4703517, 678598, 59737, '<td valign="top">A tighter crop on the bike would have been better for me, maybe the opposite angle. Looks like they should have done a better job chaining it up</td>', 'A tighter crop on the bike would have been better for me, maybe the opposite angle. Looks like they should have done a better job chaining it up', '2008-05-15 01:59:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4703557, 677666, 86331, '<td valign="top">Great capture. The motion blur is great. But I will be honest, in my personal opinion, I''m not entirely too sure with the color choice, but nevertheless the shot is great. 8 from me. Good Luck.</td>', 'Great capture. The motion blur is great. But I will be honest, in my personal opinion, I''m not entirely too sure with the color choice, but nevertheless the shot is great. 8 from me. Good Luck.', '2008-05-15 02:56:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4703558, 677171, 86331, '<td valign="top">I love the line up, the colors, the shot. It can be seen that you have a great eye for photography. The only problem(s) I see that could hurt your final score are the slight overexposed areas/wash outs on some of the bicycles front tire guard and handle bars. But I love the depth of field, and the focus is great. Good luck and well done.</td>', 'I love the line up, the colors, the shot. It can be seen that you have a great eye for photography. The only problem(s) I see that could hurt your final score are the slight overexposed areas/wash outs on some of the bicycles front tire guard and handle bars. But I love the depth of field, and the focus is great. Good luck and well done.', '2008-05-15 02:58:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4703561, 678457, 86331, '<td valign="top">The aged feeling that I get when I see this shot is what really sets this photograph from the others apart. I think you framed it very nicely, and I think the idea is great. Although, and I hate to sound picky, I see this as a black and white, and I also feel as though more "age" could have been added. I mean adjustments to really bring out the wear and tear. Nevertheless, a good shot. Good luck.</td>', 'The aged feeling that I get when I see this shot is what really sets this photograph from the others apart. I think you framed it very nicely, and I think the idea is great. Although, and I hate to sound picky, I see this as a black and white, and I also feel as though more "age" could have been added. I mean adjustments to really bring out the wear and tear. Nevertheless, a good shot. Good luck.', '2008-05-15 03:04:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4703567, 678604, 77724, '<td valign="top">Excellent job on the pan, I would like it better if the open space was in front of the rider rather than behind</td>', 'Excellent job on the pan, I would like it better if the open space was in front of the rider rather than behind', '2008-05-15 03:10:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4703586, 678353, 88523, '<td valign="top">Hey! Great street shot!  I wonder if you''ll get the bike isn''t in focus comments...</td>', 'Hey! Great street shot!  I wonder if you''ll get the bike isn''t in focus comments...', '2008-05-15 03:26:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4703587, 677156, 88523, '<td valign="top">Awesome ripples...</td>', 'Awesome ripples...', '2008-05-15 03:27:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4703588, 678561, 88523, '<td valign="top">I like the way the cyclist has come out.  A bit too much dark space on the left for me. Still, I like it.</td>', 'I like the way the cyclist has come out.  A bit too much dark space on the left for me. Still, I like it.', '2008-05-15 03:28:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4703593, 677428, 88523, '<td valign="top">Great shot!  I like the way the cyclist is highlighted in the shadows.  I wonder what it would look like if you rotated 180?</td>', 'Great shot!  I like the way the cyclist is highlighted in the shadows.  I wonder what it would look like if you rotated 180?', '2008-05-15 03:31:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4703595, 678533, 88523, '<td valign="top">Great alley and bike.  I like the way the light from your lighter serves as a continuation of the street lights further down the alley.</td>', 'Great alley and bike.  I like the way the light from your lighter serves as a continuation of the street lights further down the alley.', '2008-05-15 03:33:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4703727, 678116, 91405, '<td valign="top">OOF</td>', 'OOF', '2008-05-15 08:00:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4703729, 678399, 91405, '<td valign="top">not much in focus</td>', 'not much in focus', '2008-05-15 08:02:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4703732, 678446, 68514, '<td valign="top">I think the vertical cut doesn''t work well.</td>', 'I think the vertical cut doesn''t work well.', '2008-05-15 08:05:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4703762, 678445, 87252, '<td valign="top">Woody - Nooo! Great concept, like it.</td>', 'Woody - Nooo! Great concept, like it.', '2008-05-15 08:29:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4703779, 678543, 47906, '<td valign="top">Good idea with the garden planter as the subject, however there are a few things that would make it a stronger photo. Firstly the highlighting in the back left competes with your subject for attention, your eye will go to the brightest area of the photo first it is automatically drawn to brighter objects, also in my opinion the crop vertically feels like it is squishing the subject in both directions I would like to see a bit more in each direction is its possible. The rear of your subject seems to be obscured by the dandelions also, maybe if you had cleared the foreground and left the ones behind you would be able to see if better. I do like the slight angle that the bike is shot on, it is just enough to give the photo a bit of depth.</td>', 'Good idea with the garden planter as the subject, however there are a few things that would make it a stronger photo. Firstly the highlighting in the back left competes with your subject for attention, your eye will go to the brightest area of the photo first it is automatically drawn to brighter objects, also in my opinion the crop vertically feels like it is squishing the subject in both directions I would like to see a bit more in each direction is its possible. The rear of your subject seems to be obscured by the dandelions also, maybe if you had cleared the foreground and left the ones behind you would be able to see if better. I do like the slight angle that the bike is shot on, it is just enough to give the photo a bit of depth.', '2008-05-15 08:36:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4703832, 678080, 59737, '<td valign="top">fun picture, I''d like to see the set-up of this</td>', 'fun picture, I''d like to see the set-up of this', '2008-05-15 09:30:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4703834, 677755, 59737, '<td valign="top">Really interesting bike, there could be numerous pictures made from this, really like the crank handles, this would be a great work-out</td>', 'Really interesting bike, there could be numerous pictures made from this, really like the crank handles, this would be a great work-out', '2008-05-15 09:33:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4703837, 678614, 59737, '<td valign="top">The shallow depth of field did not appeal to me in the small version but seeing it large I do like this, the level of detail and the grease on the chain really stand out.  I also like the colour variation from back to front.</td>', 'The shallow depth of field did not appeal to me in the small version but seeing it large I do like this, the level of detail and the grease on the chain really stand out.  I also like the colour variation from back to front.', '2008-05-15 09:35:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4703845, 677825, 59737, '<td valign="top">Really a lot going on here, I think a more detailed tighter picture of the vines growing over the bike would have made for a better picture.  I''d also like to see a black and white version as there seems to be a lot of contrast and variation to the colour.</td>', 'Really a lot going on here, I think a more detailed tighter picture of the vines growing over the bike would have made for a better picture.  I''d also like to see a black and white version as there seems to be a lot of contrast and variation to the colour.', '2008-05-15 09:38:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4703848, 677867, 59737, '<td valign="top">This has pleasing colours but is out of focus and I don''t care for the angle of the shot.</td>', 'This has pleasing colours but is out of focus and I don''t care for the angle of the shot.', '2008-05-15 09:39:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4703857, 678519, 59737, '<td valign="top">I didn''t really care for this in the thumbnail but the full size version works much better for me, this is one of my favorite of the rusted bikes, I like to broken spokes of the front wheel and how the bike is placed in the frame.  The level of detail in the clouds, grass and background is also very good, excellent depth of field.</td>', 'I didn''t really care for this in the thumbnail but the full size version works much better for me, this is one of my favorite of the rusted bikes, I like to broken spokes of the front wheel and how the bike is placed in the frame.  The level of detail in the clouds, grass and background is also very good, excellent depth of field.', '2008-05-15 09:42:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4703859, 678513, 59737, '<td valign="top">Not a very good picture here, lots of blown highlights, not a good angle, just not very interesting</td>', 'Not a very good picture here, lots of blown highlights, not a good angle, just not very interesting', '2008-05-15 09:43:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4703865, 678341, 59737, '<td valign="top">Really like this, it is a very clean image.  There is a good level of detail the chrome is nice and shiny and I like the flag in the background.  One of my favorites of the challenge.</td>', 'Really like this, it is a very clean image.  There is a good level of detail the chrome is nice and shiny and I like the flag in the background.  One of my favorites of the challenge.', '2008-05-15 09:47:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4703868, 678575, 85799, '<td valign="top">That is a beautiful bike, and it looks like the rider is in decent shape, its a shame you couldn''t have captured it in motion and color.</td>', 'That is a beautiful bike, and it looks like the rider is in decent shape, its a shame you couldn''t have captured it in motion and color.', '2008-05-15 09:49:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4703875, 678446, 85799, '<td valign="top">It would be better if the sun was in front of him instead of behind.</td>', 'It would be better if the sun was in front of him instead of behind.', '2008-05-15 09:52:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4703879, 677666, 85799, '<td valign="top">Not sure I buy the title, but it is a nice photo.</td>', 'Not sure I buy the title, but it is a nice photo.', '2008-05-15 09:53:40.000000', NULL, 1),
