(4703979, 678353, 89429, '<td valign="top">Interesting photo with fantastic composition.  I like how the bike isn''t what''s in focus but it''s in the foreground.  Good choice with the sepia</td>', 'Interesting photo with fantastic composition.  I like how the bike isn''t what''s in focus but it''s in the foreground.  Good choice with the sepia', '2008-05-15 10:40:50.000000', NULL, 1),
