(4704470, 677507, 80458, '<td valign="top">excellent shot! one of my favorites in the competition. You caught this at the perfect time and the perfect time of day. wow.</td>', 'excellent shot! one of my favorites in the competition. You caught this at the perfect time and the perfect time of day. wow.', '2008-05-15 13:43:12.000000', NULL, 1),
