(4704499, 677597, 80458, '<td valign="top">very clever interpreation of the challenge. I''m sure you will get a lot of DNMC''s but I got it :)<br/> <br/>However, the photo is kind of flat. The cards in the back left are distracting.</td>', 'very clever interpreation of the challenge. I''m sure you will get a lot of DNMC''s but I got it :) However, the photo is kind of flat. The cards in the back left are distracting.', '2008-05-15 13:53:56.000000', NULL, 1),
