(4704537, 678616, 39679, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting shot but, because the point of focus is in the very back of the frame, I get the feeling that the entire image is forground which is strangely disturbing.</td>', 'This is an interesting shot but, because the point of focus is in the very back of the frame, I get the feeling that the entire image is forground which is strangely disturbing.', '2008-05-15 14:15:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4704556, 678080, 83313, '<td valign="top">Kind of interesting. How did you do the bike and E.T.?</td>', 'Kind of interesting. How did you do the bike and E.T.?', '2008-05-15 14:21:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4704558, 677671, 83313, '<td valign="top">Looks like some serious speed. I''m not brave enough to try a fixed gear.</td>', 'Looks like some serious speed. I''m not brave enough to try a fixed gear.', '2008-05-15 14:23:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4704561, 678341, 83313, '<td valign="top">The title makes an ironic statement. I really like this entry. Nice and bold, with just the right sharpness and DOF.</td>', 'The title makes an ironic statement. I really like this entry. Nice and bold, with just the right sharpness and DOF.', '2008-05-15 14:24:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4704564, 678604, 83313, '<td valign="top">This one is not really grabbing me, but I''m not sure why. Perhaps the panning blur is not quite enough to make the subject stand out.</td>', 'This one is not really grabbing me, but I''m not sure why. Perhaps the panning blur is not quite enough to make the subject stand out.', '2008-05-15 14:27:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4704566, 677732, 83313, '<td valign="top">And carrying plenty of the traditional cyclist''s power-food!</td>', 'And carrying plenty of the traditional cyclist''s power-food!', '2008-05-15 14:28:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4704571, 677859, 83313, '<td valign="top">This could have been a reasonably well scoring entry, but it''s seriously lacking in a couple of technical regards. I think the lighting and color is great. I find the composition to be a little too low in the frame, however. That bit may be a matter of preference.<br/> <br/>The other big thing is JPEG compression. There is lots of blurry pixelation visible on the frame. Your file size of only 29k also indicates a highly compressed image and that is what is robbing most of the detail and sharpness from this image. Check your compression settings when you save your file. Always adjust JPEG compression so that your file size is as large as possible, but within the challenge limit. (150k for this one)</td>', 'This could have been a reasonably well scoring entry, but it''s seriously lacking in a couple of technical regards. I think the lighting and color is great. I find the composition to be a little too low in the frame, however. That bit may be a matter of preference. The other big thing is JPEG compression. There is lots of blurry pixelation visible on the frame. Your file size of only 29k also indicates a highly compressed image and that is what is robbing most of the detail and sharpness from this image. Check your compression settings when you save your file. Always adjust JPEG compression so that your file size is as large as possible, but within the challenge limit. (150k for this one)', '2008-05-15 14:33:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4704579, 678353, 83313, '<td valign="top">Reminds me of this famous photo from the end of WWII:<br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//www.cafehistoria.net/casahistoria_latest_rambl/images/2007/08/15/vj_day_kiss.jpg'', strrpos(''//www.cafehistoria.net/casahistoria_latest_rambl/images/2007/08/15/vj_day_kiss.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.cafehistoria.net/casahistoria_latest_rambl/images/2007/08/15/vj_day_kiss.jpg"/> <br/> <br/>My only quibble is that because of the focus, the subject is not the bicycle, but the kissing couple.</td>', 'Reminds me of this famous photo from the end of WWII:  My only quibble is that because of the focus, the subject is not the bicycle, but the kissing couple.', '2008-05-15 14:38:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4704581, 678026, 83313, '<td valign="top">Kind of interesting, however, there is a lot of graininess to the background that takes away from it</td>', 'Kind of interesting, however, there is a lot of graininess to the background that takes away from it', '2008-05-15 14:39:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4704583, 677755, 83313, '<td valign="top">I used to know a wheelchair bound woman in my local bicycle club that rode a hand cranked trike. She could keep up fairly well, and I would not want to arm wrestle her!</td>', 'I used to know a wheelchair bound woman in my local bicycle club that rode a hand cranked trike. She could keep up fairly well, and I would not want to arm wrestle her!', '2008-05-15 14:40:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4704585, 678096, 83313, '<td valign="top">I like the viewpoint here.</td>', 'I like the viewpoint here.', '2008-05-15 14:41:20.000000', NULL, 1),
