(4704599, 678027, 83313, '<td valign="top">Is there anyone over 40 who did not have streamers on their first bike?<br/> <br/>*Knock, knock*<br/>JPEG Police here...<br/> <br/>There is a lack of sharpness to this photo and I think most of it is due to the use of excessive JPEG compression. Your file size of only 35k indicates a highly compressed image and that is what is robbing a lot of the detail and sharpness from this image. Check your compression settings when you save your file. Always adjust JPEG compression so that your file size is as large as possible, but within the challenge limit. (150k for this one)<br/> <br/>The nature of the image covers it well, and I am likely the only one who will notice this.</td>', 'Is there anyone over 40 who did not have streamers on their first bike? *Knock, knock*JPEG Police here... There is a lack of sharpness to this photo and I think most of it is due to the use of excessive JPEG compression. Your file size of only 35k indicates a highly compressed image and that is what is robbing a lot of the detail and sharpness from this image. Check your compression settings when you save your file. Always adjust JPEG compression so that your file size is as large as possible, but within the challenge limit. (150k for this one) The nature of the image covers it well, and I am likely the only one who will notice this.', '2008-05-15 14:50:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4704600, 677438, 83313, '<td valign="top">Cute, however this comes off to me as more of a snapshot. The centering of the cat and the tilted pole are the two big problems for me.</td>', 'Cute, however this comes off to me as more of a snapshot. The centering of the cat and the tilted pole are the two big problems for me.', '2008-05-15 14:52:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4704603, 678463, 83313, '<td valign="top">Not a bad view, but as a photo, it''s not really grabbing me, I''m afraid. Not sure what to suggest other than perhaps a different viewpoint over the bars. I think there is just not really any leading composition going on.</td>', 'Not a bad view, but as a photo, it''s not really grabbing me, I''m afraid. Not sure what to suggest other than perhaps a different viewpoint over the bars. I think there is just not really any leading composition going on.', '2008-05-15 14:55:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4704604, 678025, 83313, '<td valign="top">Nice perspective, and I like the partial desaturation. This same effect has done well for a few photos of my own.</td>', 'Nice perspective, and I like the partial desaturation. This same effect has done well for a few photos of my own.', '2008-05-15 14:56:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4704606, 677557, 83313, '<td valign="top">Which one belongs to the CEO?</td>', 'Which one belongs to the CEO?', '2008-05-15 14:57:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4704608, 677867, 83313, '<td valign="top">Almost nailed this one, except for two biggies. First is there sees to be a bit of visible blurriness, probably camera shake from a low shutter speed. I also find the wide angle perspective to be a little odd looking for this shot. The colors and subject are great, however. I''d love to see some of your outtakes after the challenge.</td>', 'Almost nailed this one, except for two biggies. First is there sees to be a bit of visible blurriness, probably camera shake from a low shutter speed. I also find the wide angle perspective to be a little odd looking for this shot. The colors and subject are great, however. I''d love to see some of your outtakes after the challenge.', '2008-05-15 15:00:10.000000', NULL, 1),
