(4705520, 678277, 83313, '<td valign="top">This sure brings back some memories. My first bike was a purple stingray, from Williams Cyclery on Long Island. Hmmm. I wonder if they are still in business?</td>', 'This sure brings back some memories. My first bike was a purple stingray, from Williams Cyclery on Long Island. Hmmm. I wonder if they are still in business?', '2008-05-15 23:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4705522, 678119, 83313, '<td valign="top">I like the way the trike stands out with brighter colors. If it blended in this would not work nearly as well. Also a nice bokeh background to tune out other distractions.</td>', 'I like the way the trike stands out with brighter colors. If it blended in this would not work nearly as well. Also a nice bokeh background to tune out other distractions.', '2008-05-15 23:04:27.000000', NULL, 1),
