(4705530, 678558, 83313, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure how well this will do with everyone else, but I think it''s a pretty cool looking motion blur. Some excessive graininess in the sky.</td>', 'I''m not sure how well this will do with everyone else, but I think it''s a pretty cool looking motion blur. Some excessive graininess in the sky.', '2008-05-15 23:10:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4705531, 678561, 83313, '<td valign="top">I know its a night ride, but I think it''s still a bit too dark in the wrong places. If the light were on his front, instead of his rear, it might help.</td>', 'I know its a night ride, but I think it''s still a bit too dark in the wrong places. If the light were on his front, instead of his rear, it might help.', '2008-05-15 23:11:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4705537, 678469, 83313, '<td valign="top">Kind of a neat look, but it still strikes me as a snapshot. Some color tweaks would help to accentuate the texture of the snow on the bike, giving it a little more visual oomph.</td>', 'Kind of a neat look, but it still strikes me as a snapshot. Some color tweaks would help to accentuate the texture of the snow on the bike, giving it a little more visual oomph.', '2008-05-15 23:13:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4705540, 678401, 83313, '<td valign="top">I like the way the texture of the hub shows in the light. Pretty good DOF and sharpness on this. Nice.</td>', 'I like the way the texture of the hub shows in the light. Pretty good DOF and sharpness on this. Nice.', '2008-05-15 23:15:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4705541, 678628, 83313, '<td valign="top">A simple and effective view. Nice contrast between the orange and green.</td>', 'A simple and effective view. Nice contrast between the orange and green.', '2008-05-15 23:15:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4705545, 677711, 83313, '<td valign="top">A good action shot, though I think maybe it needed a slower shutter speed, as there is no impression of speed coming across in this.</td>', 'A good action shot, though I think maybe it needed a slower shutter speed, as there is no impression of speed coming across in this.', '2008-05-15 23:17:37.000000', NULL, 1),
