(4710983, 678341, 79242, '<td valign="top">Despite the xenophobic title......I give this a 8(my best so far in the challenge). I hope that people realize that the reason everything in America is made in China is because of corporate greed and insatiable consumer demand.<br/> <br/>*after voting was done, this picture ended as my #3 pick.</td>', 'Despite the xenophobic title......I give this a 8(my best so far in the challenge). I hope that people realize that the reason everything in America is made in China is because of corporate greed and insatiable consumer demand. *after voting was done, this picture ended as my #3 pick.', '2008-05-19 09:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
