(4711310, 677148, 86447, '<td valign="top">Perhaps more Depth of Field on this would add to this photo.  As it is, the only thing that''s in focus is the bit of the purple bike... and there''s not enough of it in the frame to hold my interest long enough to examine the rest (unless I''m giving a critique.  *smile* )  The scene is a good one.  Good find.</td>', 'Perhaps more Depth of Field on this would add to this photo.  As it is, the only thing that''s in focus is the bit of the purple bike... and there''s not enough of it in the frame to hold my interest long enough to examine the rest (unless I''m giving a critique.  *smile* )  The scene is a good one.  Good find.', '2008-05-19 12:50:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4711311, 678115, 86447, '<td valign="top">Not sharp enough or enough contrast to suit me.   It needs true blacks and true whites, I think.</td>', 'Not sharp enough or enough contrast to suit me.   It needs true blacks and true whites, I think.', '2008-05-19 12:51:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4711314, 678260, 86447, '<td valign="top">I like the shadow and scene you had in mind... I''m not sure the hand adds anything...  And I think all of the grip would be better if it were seen.</td>', 'I like the shadow and scene you had in mind... I''m not sure the hand adds anything...  And I think all of the grip would be better if it were seen.', '2008-05-19 12:52:34.000000', NULL, 1),
