(4711677, 678569, 51793, '<td valign="top">There is way too much going on in this picture. My eyes are all over the place and it''s hard to focus on the bike because it blends in with everything else. Try removing or isolating the subject from it''s background in other ways. Also the shadows on the image makes me think that you just walked out back snapped a shot and came back in and entered it just to have something to enter. Sorry but it''s the way this image talks to me.</td>', 'There is way too much going on in this picture. My eyes are all over the place and it''s hard to focus on the bike because it blends in with everything else. Try removing or isolating the subject from it''s background in other ways. Also the shadows on the image makes me think that you just walked out back snapped a shot and came back in and entered it just to have something to enter. Sorry but it''s the way this image talks to me.', '2008-05-19 16:21:14.000000', NULL, 1),
