(4711755, 678558, 51793, '<td valign="top">I don''t care for the blurry bike, Makes me think that you were just shooting the BG or it was the main focal point of your image.</td>', 'I don''t care for the blurry bike, Makes me think that you were just shooting the BG or it was the main focal point of your image.', '2008-05-19 16:46:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4711756, 678096, 51793, '<td valign="top">Lacks interest</td>', 'Lacks interest', '2008-05-19 16:46:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4711757, 678025, 51793, '<td valign="top">I would like to see more of the bike I think.</td>', 'I would like to see more of the bike I think.', '2008-05-19 16:47:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4711885, 677156, 61961, '<td valign="top">I know I''ve seen this before (or one very, very much like it), but I can''t recall where! Anyway, good job.</td>', 'I know I''ve seen this before (or one very, very much like it), but I can''t recall where! Anyway, good job.', '2008-05-19 18:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4712041, 677666, 82985, '<td valign="top">crisp and dynamic, well done! 8</td>', 'crisp and dynamic, well done! 8', '2008-05-19 20:58:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4712048, 677428, 82985, '<td valign="top">dramatic, well seen composition. while some might say it is too contrasty, I actually like the feel of this, the mood, and the curving line thru the image adds a flow to it that is really nice.  8</td>', 'dramatic, well seen composition. while some might say it is too contrasty, I actually like the feel of this, the mood, and the curving line thru the image adds a flow to it that is really nice.  8', '2008-05-19 21:00:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4712058, 678277, 82985, '<td valign="top">I love the color in this, the composition.  Might have wished for more depth of field (though not much more, as the oof seat adds a sense of depth and dimension).  Assuming a shallow depth of field was necessary, you picked the right focal point. Since the "sissy bar" is actually carrying the highlight of the image, it tends to draw the eye there, and then disappoints by being unsharp. After the basic editing limitations are gone, a subtle burn-down of that element so that it is not the brightest might be worth a try.  But I really like the image overall, and it is a refreshing entry in the Bike challenge.  8</td>', 'I love the color in this, the composition.  Might have wished for more depth of field (though not much more, as the oof seat adds a sense of depth and dimension).  Assuming a shallow depth of field was necessary, you picked the right focal point. Since the "sissy bar" is actually carrying the highlight of the image, it tends to draw the eye there, and then disappoints by being unsharp. After the basic editing limitations are gone, a subtle burn-down of that element so that it is not the brightest might be worth a try.  But I really like the image overall, and it is a refreshing entry in the Bike challenge.  8', '2008-05-19 21:05:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4712064, 678353, 82985, '<td valign="top">So, you will probably get a lot of "wish the bike was in focus" sorta comments.  I will say that the bike/rider being out of focus actually makes this image work for me.  The sharply focused kissing couple is wonderful, and having my eye drift off the oof bike and find them is a nice surprise. <br/> <br/>You might crop out the serious looking woman on the left, even though it means losing a bit of the rider''s arm.  Keep all of the front tire in, I think it will work even better.  She kinda kills the mood created by the rest of the image.  Still I like this a lot. 8</td>', 'So, you will probably get a lot of "wish the bike was in focus" sorta comments.  I will say that the bike/rider being out of focus actually makes this image work for me.  The sharply focused kissing couple is wonderful, and having my eye drift off the oof bike and find them is a nice surprise.  You might crop out the serious looking woman on the left, even though it means losing a bit of the rider''s arm.  Keep all of the front tire in, I think it will work even better.  She kinda kills the mood created by the rest of the image.  Still I like this a lot. 8', '2008-05-19 21:09:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4712065, 678027, 82985, '<td valign="top">a refreshing entry in this challenge, nicely seen, composed, with a good use of negative space. 7</td>', 'a refreshing entry in this challenge, nicely seen, composed, with a good use of negative space. 7', '2008-05-19 21:11:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4712075, 677507, 10818, '<td valign="top">Great angle.  The shadow and the biker paint symbol really make this shot.</td>', 'Great angle.  The shadow and the biker paint symbol really make this shot.', '2008-05-19 21:17:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4712082, 677732, 10818, '<td valign="top">That is really funny.  Great capture, the colors of the banana plants and car really work well.</td>', 'That is really funny.  Great capture, the colors of the banana plants and car really work well.', '2008-05-19 21:20:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4712087, 678080, 10818, '<td valign="top">Amazing photo.  That dude has been flying around for 25 years.  :)<br/>Highest marks, should do real well.</td>', 'Amazing photo.  That dude has been flying around for 25 years.  :)Highest marks, should do real well.', '2008-05-19 21:25:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4712210, 678287, 83313, '<td valign="top">A nice shot, though I think the tilt is a bit too much.</td>', 'A nice shot, though I think the tilt is a bit too much.', '2008-05-19 23:03:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4712211, 678484, 83313, '<td valign="top">I don''t even like cheese and I want some now.</td>', 'I don''t even like cheese and I want some now.', '2008-05-19 23:03:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4712213, 678508, 83313, '<td valign="top">Wonderful selective desat. I might''ve cropped just a touch more off the right side, or made it a little taller. Just seems a little too wide to me, but that''s a nitpick on something I just faved.</td>', 'Wonderful selective desat. I might''ve cropped just a touch more off the right side, or made it a little taller. Just seems a little too wide to me, but that''s a nitpick on something I just faved.', '2008-05-19 23:05:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4712214, 678569, 89426, '<td valign="top">I like the different colors in this picture.</td>', 'I like the different colors in this picture.', '2008-05-19 23:06:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4712215, 678614, 83313, '<td valign="top">Nice patterns here. Too bad such images are difficult with getting a deep DOF.</td>', 'Nice patterns here. Too bad such images are difficult with getting a deep DOF.', '2008-05-19 23:06:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4712216, 678495, 89426, '<td valign="top">I like the value and contrast in this picture.</td>', 'I like the value and contrast in this picture.', '2008-05-19 23:06:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4712217, 677011, 89426, '<td valign="top">A little plain for me, but nicely taken</td>', 'A little plain for me, but nicely taken', '2008-05-19 23:07:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4712218, 678589, 89426, '<td valign="top">The bike is not the main focus in this picture.</td>', 'The bike is not the main focus in this picture.', '2008-05-19 23:07:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4712220, 678025, 89426, '<td valign="top">I really like the colors in this picture.</td>', 'I really like the colors in this picture.', '2008-05-19 23:08:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4712221, 677796, 89426, '<td valign="top">Crazy scene, but I like it</td>', 'Crazy scene, but I like it', '2008-05-19 23:08:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4712222, 678505, 83313, '<td valign="top">Better not leave it out in the weather till spring, though.</td>', 'Better not leave it out in the weather till spring, though.', '2008-05-19 23:08:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4712223, 678645, 89426, '<td valign="top">Not a very good picture, sorry</td>', 'Not a very good picture, sorry', '2008-05-19 23:08:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4712225, 677651, 83313, '<td valign="top">Nice and contrasty with good detail and visual impact.</td>', 'Nice and contrasty with good detail and visual impact.', '2008-05-19 23:09:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4712226, 677624, 89426, '<td valign="top">A little boring for me, sorry</td>', 'A little boring for me, sorry', '2008-05-19 23:09:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4712227, 677401, 89426, '<td valign="top">I like the background in the picture.</td>', 'I like the background in the picture.', '2008-05-19 23:09:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4712228, 677732, 89426, '<td valign="top">Very interesting picture. I like the colors</td>', 'Very interesting picture. I like the colors', '2008-05-19 23:10:13.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(4712229, 678607, 89426, '<td valign="top">Boring focus for me</td>', 'Boring focus for me', '2008-05-19 23:10:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4712230, 677428, 89426, '<td valign="top">I really like the values and contrast in this picture.</td>', 'I really like the values and contrast in this picture.', '2008-05-19 23:10:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4712231, 677735, 89426, '<td valign="top">The background is distracting to me, sorry</td>', 'The background is distracting to me, sorry', '2008-05-19 23:11:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4712233, 678508, 89426, '<td valign="top">Nice value and contrast</td>', 'Nice value and contrast', '2008-05-19 23:11:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4712234, 678360, 83313, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure about the meaning of the title, I like the maroon color here. I find my eye is drawn to the head tube, but that''s not where the focus is.</td>', 'I''m not sure about the meaning of the title, I like the maroon color here. I find my eye is drawn to the head tube, but that''s not where the focus is.', '2008-05-19 23:11:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4712235, 678556, 89426, '<td valign="top">Nice color and bike in general</td>', 'Nice color and bike in general', '2008-05-19 23:11:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4712236, 678118, 89426, '<td valign="top">Very unique take</td>', 'Very unique take', '2008-05-19 23:12:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4712238, 678111, 83313, '<td valign="top">Background is a bit busy with some blown out highlights. With some darker exposure, I think it might work better, but it''s got potential.</td>', 'Background is a bit busy with some blown out highlights. With some darker exposure, I think it might work better, but it''s got potential.', '2008-05-19 23:12:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4712243, 678445, 83313, '<td valign="top">*sigh* When is that knothead going to learn!? I love the detail touch of the cycling gloves. Photo is good, though not great. Major kudos, however, for the creativity and a fine addition to the "Woody collection".</td>', '*sigh* When is that knothead going to learn!? I love the detail touch of the cycling gloves. Photo is good, though not great. Major kudos, however, for the creativity and a fine addition to the "Woody collection".', '2008-05-19 23:16:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4712244, 678028, 83313, '<td valign="top">A cool looking semi-abstract.</td>', 'A cool looking semi-abstract.', '2008-05-19 23:16:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4712245, 677449, 83313, '<td valign="top">Nice grungy details and a good use of the DOF.</td>', 'Nice grungy details and a good use of the DOF.', '2008-05-19 23:17:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4712250, 677563, 83313, '<td valign="top">Good panning and overall visual impact on this. I''m not sure whether I dislike the slight tilt, or if it actually adds to the impression of motion.</td>', 'Good panning and overall visual impact on this. I''m not sure whether I dislike the slight tilt, or if it actually adds to the impression of motion.', '2008-05-19 23:18:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4712253, 677888, 83313, '<td valign="top">If he put a bit of air in that rear tire, he might get to work a little quicker and less sweaty.</td>', 'If he put a bit of air in that rear tire, he might get to work a little quicker and less sweaty.', '2008-05-19 23:19:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4712290, 678446, 83313, '<td valign="top">A nice colorful action shot. Good motion blur.</td>', 'A nice colorful action shot. Good motion blur.', '2008-05-20 00:14:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4712360, 678281, 83313, '<td valign="top">A little dark around the water bottle, but well composed and good colors.</td>', 'A little dark around the water bottle, but well composed and good colors.', '2008-05-20 00:57:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4712361, 678122, 83313, '<td valign="top">I strikes me as if all the subjects that my eye is drawn to are cut off at frame edge. There''s a lot going on here, with 3 bikes intermingled.</td>', 'I strikes me as if all the subjects that my eye is drawn to are cut off at frame edge. There''s a lot going on here, with 3 bikes intermingled.', '2008-05-20 00:58:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4712365, 678117, 83313, '<td valign="top">Nice bold color, but it seems like a snapshot with both the bike and rider cut off. There''s also a fair amount of background clutter, like the trash can and fence that tend to draw the eye away from the main subject.</td>', 'Nice bold color, but it seems like a snapshot with both the bike and rider cut off. There''s also a fair amount of background clutter, like the trash can and fence that tend to draw the eye away from the main subject.', '2008-05-20 01:01:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4712368, 678569, 83313, '<td valign="top">But it was well loved at one time. <br/> <br/>Seems perhaps a touch oversaturated, and your image size is much smaller than was allowed for this challenge. It''s a good idea to always have your long dimension as large as allowed, for maximum visible detail.</td>', 'But it was well loved at one time.  Seems perhaps a touch oversaturated, and your image size is much smaller than was allowed for this challenge. It''s a good idea to always have your long dimension as large as allowed, for maximum visible detail.', '2008-05-20 01:03:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4712369, 678202, 85563, '<td valign="top">I love the composition and colour in the rust.  I''d go for a little more contrast to really make it stand out.</td>', 'I love the composition and colour in the rust.  I''d go for a little more contrast to really make it stand out.', '2008-05-20 01:03:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4712370, 678650, 85563, '<td valign="top">My eyes aren''t really drawn to the bicycle in this photo.  It''s a cool shot, but maybe too slow of a shutter speed to pull off the full effect I think.</td>', 'My eyes aren''t really drawn to the bicycle in this photo.  It''s a cool shot, but maybe too slow of a shutter speed to pull off the full effect I think.', '2008-05-20 01:04:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4712372, 677666, 85563, '<td valign="top">I really love the panning on this photo and the composition.  This panning shot has what the others are missing.... I love it.</td>', 'I really love the panning on this photo and the composition.  This panning shot has what the others are missing.... I love it.', '2008-05-20 01:04:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4712375, 677831, 85563, '<td valign="top">Love the composition and use of the shadow in this photo.  Good use of b&amp;w</td>', 'Love the composition and use of the shadow in this photo.  Good use of b&w', '2008-05-20 01:04:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4712376, 678575, 83313, '<td valign="top">I little posterization on the "pistons", and I''m not fond of the wrinkled fabric in the background. I like the comp and the view on this though.</td>', 'I little posterization on the "pistons", and I''m not fond of the wrinkled fabric in the background. I like the comp and the view on this though.', '2008-05-20 01:05:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4712377, 678117, 85563, '<td valign="top">Although I like the colour in this photo, it doesn''t look like much planning or setup was involved.</td>', 'Although I like the colour in this photo, it doesn''t look like much planning or setup was involved.', '2008-05-20 01:05:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4712378, 678479, 83313, '<td valign="top">Nice catch. How many times did you have to try to get this?</td>', 'Nice catch. How many times did you have to try to get this?', '2008-05-20 01:06:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4712379, 678645, 85563, '<td valign="top">I can definitely distinguish the subject, but the flash really shows up in the darkness.  Also quite grainy.</td>', 'I can definitely distinguish the subject, but the flash really shows up in the darkness.  Also quite grainy.', '2008-05-20 01:06:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4712380, 678643, 83313, '<td valign="top">Great texture of the rubber. Nice and contrasty, but still lots of detail.</td>', 'Great texture of the rubber. Nice and contrasty, but still lots of detail.', '2008-05-20 01:07:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4712381, 677624, 85563, '<td valign="top">I like the sharpness on the handlebar, but fear it might be too close to the edge of the shot... otherwise great composition.</td>', 'I like the sharpness on the handlebar, but fear it might be too close to the edge of the shot... otherwise great composition.', '2008-05-20 01:08:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4712384, 678391, 83313, '<td valign="top">A touch heavy on the saturation, but I like the look of it on this particular shot. The green of the spoke guard contrasts nicely with the rusty chain.</td>', 'A touch heavy on the saturation, but I like the look of it on this particular shot. The green of the spoke guard contrasts nicely with the rusty chain.', '2008-05-20 01:08:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4712385, 678458, 85563, '<td valign="top">I like the rust in this photo... gives it a great depth of colour and contrast against the background.  Good sharpness, but I might have had a larger depth of field.</td>', 'I like the rust in this photo... gives it a great depth of colour and contrast against the background.  Good sharpness, but I might have had a larger depth of field.', '2008-05-20 01:09:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4712386, 678608, 85563, '<td valign="top">Excellent use of a non-typical picture size.  I''m not a fan of the way the direction of the flash on this photo.  Like the subjects and it looks like a fun shot.</td>', 'Excellent use of a non-typical picture size.  I''m not a fan of the way the direction of the flash on this photo.  Like the subjects and it looks like a fun shot.', '2008-05-20 01:10:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4712388, 678544, 83313, '<td valign="top">Conveys the lure of the road nicely. Nice comp and sharpness, especially considering that it looks like your were riding and holding the camera at fork level.</td>', 'Conveys the lure of the road nicely. Nice comp and sharpness, especially considering that it looks like your were riding and holding the camera at fork level.', '2008-05-20 01:10:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4712390, 678627, 83313, '<td valign="top">An interesting perspective view with great colors. I''m not sure what theblack U-shaped object is, though. I think it''s probably a bike rack.</td>', 'An interesting perspective view with great colors. I''m not sure what theblack U-shaped object is, though. I think it''s probably a bike rack.', '2008-05-20 01:12:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4712392, 678125, 85563, '<td valign="top">I love the RGB (red green blue)... intentional or not,  still kind of cool.  Good composition, but I would''ve still tried to keep all the bikes in a more uniform line.</td>', 'I love the RGB (red green blue)... intentional or not,  still kind of cool.  Good composition, but I would''ve still tried to keep all the bikes in a more uniform line.', '2008-05-20 01:13:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4712393, 678230, 83313, '<td valign="top">Cool perspective. Lots of impact here.</td>', 'Cool perspective. Lots of impact here.', '2008-05-20 01:13:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4712394, 678516, 83313, '<td valign="top">A touch on the dark side, but otherwise I like this.  Well composed with good detail.</td>', 'A touch on the dark side, but otherwise I like this.  Well composed with good detail.', '2008-05-20 01:14:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4712397, 678616, 83313, '<td valign="top">I skipped on of my potential entries because of a bit of fluff like I see here.  I should have gone with it. This is pretty good in spite of the hairs.</td>', 'I skipped on of my potential entries because of a bit of fluff like I see here.  I should have gone with it. This is pretty good in spite of the hairs.', '2008-05-20 01:15:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4712401, 678508, 85563, '<td valign="top">I really like the composition and contrast and using the b&amp;w for the rest of the background.  Really makes it stand out.  My only real critique is that some of the long grass is distracting.</td>', 'I really like the composition and contrast and using the b&w for the rest of the background.  Really makes it stand out.  My only real critique is that some of the long grass is distracting.', '2008-05-20 01:17:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4712402, 677755, 85563, '<td valign="top">Picture is kind of flat, could use more contrast.</td>', 'Picture is kind of flat, could use more contrast.', '2008-05-20 01:17:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4712403, 678543, 85563, '<td valign="top">Love the sharp saturation and contrast.</td>', 'Love the sharp saturation and contrast.', '2008-05-20 01:18:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4712404, 678096, 85563, '<td valign="top">I like the perspective and use of b&amp;w.  Nice contrast and composition.</td>', 'I like the perspective and use of b&w.  Nice contrast and composition.', '2008-05-20 01:18:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4712405, 678520, 85563, '<td valign="top">I love the silhouette in this photo.  BEAUTIFUL colour in the sky.  Well thought out shot with excellent patience.</td>', 'I love the silhouette in this photo.  BEAUTIFUL colour in the sky.  Well thought out shot with excellent patience.', '2008-05-20 01:18:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4712407, 678353, 85563, '<td valign="top">Love the quote for the subject, but the bike doesn''t really seem like the focus.  Good matting.  Good contrast.</td>', 'Love the quote for the subject, but the bike doesn''t really seem like the focus.  Good matting.  Good contrast.', '2008-05-20 01:19:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4712408, 678618, 85563, '<td valign="top">Good composition... real eye-opener into the world of the fisherman in the shot.  Good b&amp;w shot.</td>', 'Good composition... real eye-opener into the world of the fisherman in the shot.  Good b&w shot.', '2008-05-20 01:20:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4712409, 678616, 85563, '<td valign="top">Good sharpness, but I''d like to see a wider depth of field.</td>', 'Good sharpness, but I''d like to see a wider depth of field.', '2008-05-20 01:20:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4712410, 677711, 85563, '<td valign="top">Great storylines in this photo and good title.  I really like the composition.</td>', 'Great storylines in this photo and good title.  I really like the composition.', '2008-05-20 01:21:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4712411, 677671, 85563, '<td valign="top">GREAT panning and GREAT colour.  This photo really stands out to be because of the saturation... RGB (Red Green Blue)... whether it was intentional or not I love it.</td>', 'GREAT panning and GREAT colour.  This photo really stands out to be because of the saturation... RGB (Red Green Blue)... whether it was intentional or not I love it.', '2008-05-20 01:21:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4712414, 678544, 85563, '<td valign="top">Great perspective, saturation, and sharpness.  I love the lines the composition of this photo draws.  Almost wants me to go pull my bike out of storage.</td>', 'Great perspective, saturation, and sharpness.  I love the lines the composition of this photo draws.  Almost wants me to go pull my bike out of storage.', '2008-05-20 01:22:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4712416, 677011, 85563, '<td valign="top">Great perspective and sharpness.  Love the contrast with the black background and this has the perfect depth of field.  GREAT shot.</td>', 'Great perspective and sharpness.  Love the contrast with the black background and this has the perfect depth of field.  GREAT shot.', '2008-05-20 01:22:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4712417, 678125, 83313, '<td valign="top">Shooting with a friend, I see. Same 3 bikes and an almost identical view. I think this color version is a bit better. The colorful frames stand out from the busyness of the scene more. Comp is ok, but could be framed a bit better. On something like this, a slight angle makes a huge difference in the scene.</td>', 'Shooting with a friend, I see. Same 3 bikes and an almost identical view. I think this color version is a bit better. The colorful frames stand out from the busyness of the scene more. Comp is ok, but could be framed a bit better. On something like this, a slight angle makes a huge difference in the scene.', '2008-05-20 01:23:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4712418, 678589, 83313, '<td valign="top">Like the title. Nice "lure of the road" scene.</td>', 'Like the title. Nice "lure of the road" scene.', '2008-05-20 01:23:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4712420, 678213, 85563, '<td valign="top">Interesting spot to go riding.  I like the colours, but the subject doesn''t seem to interesting or anything too out of the ordinary for a really high vote.</td>', 'Interesting spot to go riding.  I like the colours, but the subject doesn''t seem to interesting or anything too out of the ordinary for a really high vote.', '2008-05-20 01:23:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4712422, 677401, 85563, '<td valign="top">Good colour and composition.  Interesting subject.</td>', 'Good colour and composition.  Interesting subject.', '2008-05-20 01:24:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4712425, 677201, 85563, '<td valign="top">I love the composition and story created in this picture.  Excellent photojournalism piece.  The bicycle truly is the subject in this one.</td>', 'I love the composition and story created in this picture.  Excellent photojournalism piece.  The bicycle truly is the subject in this one.', '2008-05-20 01:24:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4712427, 677859, 85563, '<td valign="top">Great composition, saturation and contrast.  Good shot!</td>', 'Great composition, saturation and contrast.  Good shot!', '2008-05-20 01:25:22.000000', NULL, 1),
