(4716005, 677859, 20364, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by yospiff:</b></div><hr/><i> As usual, I leave some criticism on a fairly high scoring shot. At least I was the low voter who let you know why, though! Congrats on the 6 and watch those compression settings! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>No worries.  Your criticism is well taken.  I appreciate the comments very much whether positive or negative.  You left them in a positive spirit and I appreciate and learn from that.<br/> <br/>Thanks to all!  Third personal best for me.  I was not expecting it.</td>', 'Originally posted by yospiff: As usual, I leave some criticism on a fairly high scoring shot. At least I was the low voter who let you know why, though! Congrats on the 6 and watch those compression settings!   No worries.  Your criticism is well taken.  I appreciate the comments very much whether positive or negative.  You left them in a positive spirit and I appreciate and learn from that. Thanks to all!  Third personal best for me.  I was not expecting it.', '2008-05-21 19:25:55.000000', NULL, 0),
