(4717263, 678026, 54645, '<td valign="top">I like this shot. Simple, lots of emotion. I think the crop/composition and the noise kept if from scoring well. The missing portions of the tires, particularly the front, are akin to a portrait of a human cropped at a joint ;) <br/> <br/>Here is a version with noise reduction and unsharp mask. In hindsight oversharpened it, given the image size, but you get the idea! <br/> <br/>[thumb]681064[/thumb]</td>', 'I like this shot. Simple, lots of emotion. I think the crop/composition and the noise kept if from scoring well. The missing portions of the tires, particularly the front, are akin to a portrait of a human cropped at a joint ;)  Here is a version with noise reduction and unsharp mask. In hindsight oversharpened it, given the image size, but you get the idea!  [thumb]681064[/thumb]', '2008-05-22 11:02:18.000000', NULL, 0),
